-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("en",43,{
[1345]="7003A652\n1\tFind Gandalf in Edoras\tGandalf can be found at the main gate of Edoras. You should hasten to Edoras and speak with Gandalf.\n2\tFind Húlac in Stoke\tHúlac can be found in the town of Stoke in the Broadacres. You should ride to Stoke and search for Húlac.\n",
[1346]="7002C013\n1\tTalk to Brúngwath at Atburg\tBrúngwath awaits your return at Atburg, south-east of Aculf's camp in the Rushgore. Eowils instructed you to return to Brúngwath and assure him that you fulfilled your oath to him.\n2\tTalk to Wynstan at Aculf's camp in the Rushgore\tWynstan is at Aculf's camp in the Rushgore, north-west of Atburg. Eowils instructed you to return to Wynstan with the news that Brúngwath has pledged his allegiance to you.\n",
[1347]="7005D3B8\n1\tTalk to Klátha\tKlátha is located in a camp north of Bazanmanar. Nósni has asked you to speak to Klátha once more.\n2\tTalk to Nósni\tNósni is located in a garden north of Bazanmanar. You should talk to Nósni.\n3\tLight the fireworks\tThe fireworks are located in a garden north of Bazanmanar. You should light the fireworks.\n4\tTalk to Nósni\tNósni is located in a garden north of Bazanmanar. You should talk to Nósni.\n5\tTalk to Klátha\tKlátha is located in a camp north of Bazanmanar. Nósni has asked you to speak to Klátha for a final time.\n",
[1348]="700613B5\n1\tCollect Yonderboar haunches (total: 6)\030Collect fallen apples (total: 10)\tYonderboars and fallen apples can be found below the apple trees about the northern farm in Tighfield. Rosalinda North-took has asked you to collect Yonderboar meat and fallen apples.\n2\tTalk to Finola Whortleberry\tFinola is in Nobottle. You should bring the Yonderboar meat and apples to Finola Whortleberry.\n3\tUse the oven to bake a pie\tFinola and her oven are located in Nobottle. Finola has asked you to use her oven to bake an apple and Yonderboar pie.\n4\tReturn to Diamond\tDiamond North-took can be found in Nobottle. Bring the pie to Diamond.\n",
[1349]="7002AE0D\n1\tCollect green apples (total: 3)\030Collect red apples (total: 6)\030Collect golden apples (quantity: see journal)\tThe apple crate is near the vendor stall in Bywater. You should search for apples within the crate to fill this customer's order.\n2\tDeliver the apples to Daisy Sandyman at the vendor stall\tDaisy Sandyman is in Bywater in the Shire. You should deliver the apples you gathered to Daisy Sandyman.\n",
[1350]="7002F93A\n1\tTalk to Walnoth in the Mead Hall dungeon\tWalnoth will be waiting for you inside the dungeon, under the Mead Hall of Cliving. Walnoth has gone to apprehend Eldora and will be taking her to the dungeon for holding until her crimes can be fully proven.\n",
[1351]="7002F935\n1\tTalk to Walnoth in the Mead Hall dungeon\tWalnoth will be waiting for you inside the dungeon, under the Mead Hall of Cliving. Walnoth has gone to apprehend Swithorne and will hold him at the dungeon until the matter can be fully resolved.\n",
[1352]="7002F938\n1\tTalk to Walnoth in the Mead Hall dungeon\tWalnoth will be waiting for you inside the dungeon, under the Mead Hall of Cliving. Walnoth has gone to apprehend Wigfugol and will be taking him to the dungeon for holding until the crimes can be fully resolved.\n",
[1353]="7005AB0A\n1\tDefeat hobgoblin acolytes (total: 7)\tHobgoblin acolytes have been spotted learning necromancy from the Angmarim just outside the keep of Bagud-dum. You should defeat hobgoblin acolytes.\n2\tTalk to Hórin outside Bagud-dum\tHórin can be found outside the dwarf-fort Bagud-dum. You should talk to Hórin.\n",
[1354]="7002672F\n1\tFind Arantar's ring\tHaudh Arantar is to the south of the Ranger-camp in the Way of Kings. Nethrandir asked you to go venture within Haudh Arantar and find Arantar's ring before Angmar does.\n2\tBring Arantar's ring to Nethrandir in the Way of Kings\tNethrandir is at the Ranger-camp in the Way of Kings. Nethrandir will be eager to see you found Arantar's ring.\n",
[1355]="70041D8E\n1\tDefeat the archer Thisarti quickly\tDefeat the archer Thisarti swiftly, for his arrows and his aim are deadly. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n",
[1356]="700428C5\n1\tDefeat the archer Thisarti quickly\tDefeat the archer Thisarti swiftly, for his arrows and his aim are deadly. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n",
[1357]="700266DE\n1\tTalk to Nimbellas at the Way of Kings camp\tNimbellas is at the Ranger-camp in the Way of Kings, south of Tinnudir.\n",
[1358]="70007DEE\n1\tDefeat Wargs\tWargs stalk the drifts in the Misty Mountains, north and east of Rivendell, near the ridges of Pinnath Fenui. Defeat the Wargs that stalk the mountains.\n2\tDefeat Wargs (total: 8)\tWargs stalk the drifts in the Misty Mountains, north and east of Rivendell, near the ridges of Pinnath Fenui. Defeat the Wargs that stalk the mountains.\n3\tTalk to Vighar Roadwalker\tVighar Roadwalker is located in a camp at the High Crag. Vighar will be pleased to hear that you have lessened the menace of the Wargs that stalk the Misty Mountains.\n",
[1359]="70067EF3\n1\tGrease the gears ([see journal]/5)\030Stoke the forge fires with the bellows ([see journal]/5)\030Repair the pulleys (total: 2)\tTaphis asked that you assist in the maintenance of the forges to help get them back to working at full capacity. Forges can be found throughout Rakhatâb.\n2\tTalk to Taphis\tYou greased the gears, stoked the flames, and fixed the pulley system; time to return to Taphis and let her know what you have done.\n",
[1360]="70067C4C\n1\tFind and challenge Imkhâs the Cleaver\tMake your way to the north from the dock along the shoreline and look for an ancient and enormous crab there. It is called Imkhâs the Cleaver. Defeat the crab and return it to Stúkha.\n2\tReturn Imkhâs the Cleaver to Stúkha at Jax Phanâl\030Capture Imkhâs the Cleaver\tYou defeated Imkhâs. Collect the crab, which now hides in its shell, and return her to Stúkha at the crest of Jax Phanâl.\n",
[1361]="70035711\n1\tCollect axes (total: 2)\030Collect cooking supplies (total: 3)\030Collect weapons (total: 4)\tWeapons and supplies can be found on the outskirts of Byre Tor. You should collect weapons and supplies from Byre Tor without drawing attention from the Orcs, who might follow you back to the refugees' cave and endanger the women. NOTE: Drawing too much attention from the Orcs will fail this quest.\n2\tBring the supplies to Frithwyn\tFrithwyn is at the cave in the northern High Knolls. You should return to Frithwyn with the supplies.\n",
[1362]="70058BB7\n1\tDestroy barrels of Orc-armour at Bagûd-mekhem (total: 6)\030Destroy barrels of Orc-spears at Bagûd-mekhem (total: 6)\030Destroy barrels of Orc-swords at Bagûd-mekhem (total: 6)\tBarrels of Orkish armour, spears, and swords can be found at Bagûd-mekhem. You have discovered a stockpile of barrels filled with Orkish weapons and armour at Bagûd-mekhem. You should destroy barrels of Orkish armour, spears, and swords at Bagûd-mekhem.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have destroyed many barrels of Orkish armour, spears, and swords at Bagûd-mekhem.\n",
[1363]="70015E01\n1\tTalk to Gelirwen at Echad Mirobel\tEchad Mirobel is west of Echad Dúnann along the Nan Sirannon road. You have been asked to warn Echad Mirobel of the half-orc threat.\n",
[1364]="70008876\n1\tReturn to Quartermaster Apsduf\030Collect norbog-chitin (total: 10)\tNerbyg, also called Neekerbreekers, dwell near the river-banks. Quartermaster Apsduf directed you to collect chitin to craft the armour he intends for the Wargs and spiders.\n",
[1365]="700375BF\n1\tTalk to the smith\tThe smith is in Edoras. Ulf asked you to seek out the local smith and learn if he has any mail to spare for the Riders Four.\n2\tCollect armour (total: 4)\tThe armour the smith spoke of is on the ground near him. You should collect the armour the smith spoke of.\n3\tBring the armour you collected to Ulf\tUlf is in Edoras. You should bring the armour you collected to Ulf at once.\n",
[1366]="70014877\n1\tCollect goblin armour-scraps (total: 7)\tGoblins can be found in Gamil Filik, south-east of the Deep Descent camp. Stíling has asked you to collect several pieces of the goblins' armour for him to examine.\n2\tBring the armour back to Stíling\030Collect Goblin Armour-scrap (total: 7)\tStíling is at the outskirts of Gamil Filik. You should bring the armour back to Stíling for his examination.\n",
[1367]="7004327C\n1\tRecover the armour of Kin-strife warriors\tRisen armours of fallen Kin-strife warriors can be found in the river Erui in eastern Upper Lebennin. You have encountered armours given form by the waters of the Erui and should reclaim the armour pieces for the people of Gondor.\n2\tRecover the armour of Kin-strife warriors (total: 10)\tRisen armours of fallen Kin-strife warriors can be found in the river Erui in eastern Upper Lebennin. You have encountered armours given form by the waters of the Erui and should reclaim the armour pieces for the people of Gondor.\n3\tDeliver the armour pieces to Glassiel in Halach\tGlassiel can be found in Halach in south-eastern Upper Lebennin. You have defeated many of the risen armours in the Erui, and should return the armour pieces you recovered to Glassiel.\n",
[1368]="70033032\n1\tDestroy armour-piles\tArmour-piles can be found in the armoury of Uzbad-bakân in Zelem-melek. You should destroy armour-piles.\n2\tDestroy armour-piles (total: 6)\tArmour-piles can be found in the armoury of Uzbad-bakân in Zelem-melek. You should destroy armour-piles.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have destroyed much of the armour being stockpiled in Uzbad-bakân. The Orcs of Zelem-melek will be more vulnerable in the future.\n",
[1369]="70072ECB\n1\tDestroy bows (total: 8)\030Destroy spears (total: 8)\030Defeat Ordâkhai (total: 10)\tWhile fighting off any guards within, destroy any caches of spears and bows that you might find.\n2\tDefeat Mádathal the Deathward, the defender of the barracks\tDefeat Mádathal the Deathward, the defender of the barracks.\n",
[1370]="7003FFBD\n1\tLock chests (total: 4)\tThe chests must be locked to protect the weapons within.\n",
[1371]="7000A16A\n1\tDefeat the Terror within Barad Gúlaran\tFind the terror called to service in the halls of Barad Gúlaran and put an end to it before the sorceresses can summon more of the beasts to Angmar's service. Brúnfair dispatched you to Barad Gúlaran to face and defeat the great evil the sorceresses call to the service of Angmar. This army must be destroyed before it grows too large for the few defenders of Eriador to face.\n2\tTalk to Brúnfair\tYou have succeeded in defeating the terror within Barad Gúlaran. Return to Brúnfair and tell him of your victory. After a grueling battle, you successfully faced and slew the first Rogmul enslaved by the sorceresses of Barad Gúlaran.\n",
[1372]="7004ABA2\n1\tComplete Durthang: Army of the Pit\tCandúr can be found in Udûn. You should talk Candúr.\n2\tCompleted\tCompleted Durthang: Army of the Pit.\n",
[1373]="7000ED96\n1\tDefeat Arnmórth the Exacting\tFind the inner office within the Icereave Mines. Bring allies.\n2\tReturn to Thórth\tReturn to Thórth at Zigilgund with the key, and report your defeat of Arnmórth the Exacting.\n",
[1374]="70057F83\n1\tPlace floral arrangements (quantity: see journal)\tEvent locations can be found around Minas Tirith. Place the floral arrangements at event locations.\n",
[1375]="700350C8\n1\tInspect Thrymm's War-steed\tThe horse that just arrived in Forlaw can be found at the stables.\n2\tSpeak with Cyneberg\tCyneberg is standing near the new horse, and seems convinced that this is indeed Thrymm's war-steed!\n3\tReturn to Gárwig\tGárwig awaits your return at Lornsettle, to hear word of whether this is really Thrymm's horse, or only a rumour to spread false hope among the people.\n",
[1376]="7000AE15\n1\tReturn the blades to Sergeant-at-Arms Gautr at Tol Ascarnen\030Collect shattered blades (total: 5)\tOrcs and Uruks throughout the Ettenmoors carry the shattered blades taken from the Free Peoples that they defeat. Sergeant-at-Arms Gautr sent you into the Ettenmoors in search of shattered blades. He is making arrows to supply the Elves who will guard the front channel of Tol Ascarnen.\n",
})
